# D29/D30/R32: infinite source, signed cell, two independent bindings.
grid-system 7 name-hex 36303078343030 main-along u u repeat 0 600 v repeat 0 400
surface 1 origin 0 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 100,200 2500,200 2500,1800 100,1800 hole 900,600 1300,600 1300,1000 900,1000
boundary-vertex-keys 1 outer 1 2 3 4 hole 5 6 7 8 next-key 9
grid-binding 3 on-boundary 1 from-system 7 vertex-key 1 cell -2 1 anchor 0 1 0 1
grid 1 on 1 from-binding 3
surface 2 origin 2800 0 2500 u +x v +y outline 100,200 2500,200 2500,1000 1300,1000 1300,1800 100,1800
boundary-vertex-keys 2 outer 1 2 3 4 5 6 next-key 7
grid-binding 4 on-boundary 2 from-system 7 vertex-key 1 cell -2 1 anchor 1 2 1 2
grid 2 on 2 from-binding 4
canvas-pos grid-system 7 120 80
canvas-pos grid-binding 3 450 80
canvas-pos grid-binding 4 450 260
